[00:18.72]If we have listened to Christ, will we show it?
[00:24.54]His teaching shines as it shows us the way.
[00:31.46]It makes us happy to hear and to know it,
[00:37.76]But we’ll be blessed if we know and obey.
[00:44.53](Chorus)
[00:44.68]Listen, obey, and be blessed
[00:51.78]When you hear God’s will expressed.
[00:55.82]If you’d be happy and enter his rest,
[01:04.16]Listen, obey, and be blessed.
[01:19.56]Our way of life, like a house, gives protection
[01:25.76]When it is built on the rock, not on sand.
[01:32.28]If we apply Jesus’ loving direction,
[01:38.66]We’ll build a life which on bedrock will stand.
[01:45.22](Chorus)
[01:45.37]Listen, obey, and be blessed
[01:52.60]When you hear God’s will expressed.
[01:56.64]If you’d be happy and enter his rest,
[02:04.64]Listen, obey, and be blessed.
[02:10.34]Just as a tree rooted deep by the waters
[03:00.87]Gives of its fruit when each season arrives,
[03:08.68]If we obey as God’s own sons and daughters,
[03:15.12]We’ll all be blessed and enjoy endless lives.
[03:22.34](Chorus)
[03:22.49]Listen, obey, and be blessed
[03:28.98]When you hear God’s will expressed.
[03:33.10]If you’d be happy and enter his rest,
[03:42.52]Listen, obey, and be blessed.
